WEBVTT

NOTE
Audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2
File: disc02_13h.avi
Scene: The Lunatic Pandora - establishing shot and approach
Duration: approximately 31 seconds
Describes the first appearance of the massive crystal structure and its ominous presence.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A colossal rectangular crystal pillar dominates the landscape. The Lunatic Pandora — hundreds of meters tall, hovering suspended above the earth.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The structure glows with eerie purple-blue energy, pulsing like a heartbeat. Ancient crystal formations cover its surface, jagged and geometric. Galbadian forces have reactivated this ancient technology.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
The Lunatic Pandora hovers over Tears' Point or near Esthar's perimeter. Below, the landscape appears diminished by the towering alien structure's scale.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The ground beneath casts a massive shadow — darkness spreading across miles. The crystal pillar pulses with ominous purple light. This is not a natural phenomenon. This is a weapon.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
The camera pulls back, revealing the full scope of the Lunatic Pandora against the sky. Its presence is absolute and unstoppable. Humanity faces an ancient, reawakened threat.